<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-ST.POELTEN MEN'S GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ST.POELTEN MEN'S GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ST.POELTEN, Austria 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results</p>
<p>in the $425,000 St.Poelten Grand Prix men's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Wednesday (prefix denotes seeds):</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Clemens Trimmel (Austria) 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>7-Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 6-7 (4-7)</p>
<p>6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) beat Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-2</p>
<p>Karim Alami (Morocco) beat Gilbert Schaller (Austria) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>1-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 5-7 6-1</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) beat Gabriel Silberstein (Chile) 6-2</p>
<p>7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat 5-Marc Rosset (Switzerland)</p>
<p>4-0 - Rosset retired</p>
<p>Tomas Nydahl (Sweden) beat 3-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
